{"t": 1793318129502, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "debris_up", "Tick ~3969: sawing the fallen rafter raised 'Haul out the debris' from 15 left to 17 left. The status line explains it ('three pieces to haul out instead of one'), but the counter going up feels like regress; the rafter is also not a checklist line of its own. Sawing kept progress after releasing the button (18% -> 23% shown after release, resumed to 76/99/done). Total ~16 game s of sawing."]}
