{"t": 1793319004501, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "chimney", "Lit chimney stones (lantern on, scrubbed) are pale cream; the checklist text in the top-left (white with thin dark outline) is hard to read against them, e.g. 'Scrub the walls (26%)'. Also the held tool/lantern sprite covers the '8 Matches' label of the toolbar. Chimney: 0% -> 47% in ~700 ticks (~23 game s), 'Clean here. Move on.' appears quickly, but the arrow keys at low fps often do not move the view so it is hard to find the next sooty patch."]}
